verses.commentary:
9:4 This begins a series of questions (cf. 1 Cor. 9:4-7) where Paul asserts his right as an Apostle to
be supported by the local churches. However he personally chose not to exercise his rights (cf. 1 Cor. 9:15,18;
1 Thess. 2:6), but he affirms the rights of other Christian workers.
